{"id":29,"date":"2026-06-23T15:37:00","date_gmt":"2026-06-23T15:37:00","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/floens-demo-new.local\/tower-garden-growing-resource-guide-copy-4\/"},"modified":"2026-06-29T13:38:14","modified_gmt":"2026-06-29T13:38:14","slug":"kitchen-tile-trends-that-are-redefining-modern-indian-homes","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/kitchen-tile-trends-that-are-redefining-modern-indian-homes\/","title":{"rendered":"Kitchen Tile Trends That Are Redefining Modern Indian Homes"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">The modern kitchen is no longer just a functional space used for cooking. It has become one of the most important design spaces inside a home, reflecting personal style while maintaining everyday practicality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Over the past few years, homeowners have started moving towards cleaner and more premium kitchen aesthetics. Large-format tiles, subtle marble finishes, neutral tones, textured backsplashes, and matte surfaces have become extremely popular choices.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apart from appearance, kitchen tiles also need to handle heat, stains, water exposure, and frequent cleaning. This makes material selection just as important as design selection.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"blog-card__text blog-card__text--one wp-block-paragraph\">At <strong>Jain Stones &amp; Tiles<\/strong>, we help homeowners discover kitchen tile collections that bring together durability, easy maintenance, and modern design \u2014 helping create kitchens that feel elegant while functioning beautifully every single day.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" wid